      "content": "i dunno, it feels like a lot of the \"valid philosophical objections\" you mention are just being dismissed as conspiracy theories by the people pushing these urban plans. like, if people are worried about losing their autonomy, shouldn't that be treated as a serious policy concern rather than just being brushed off as paranoia?",
